    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                "word": "teratology",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f5816293-835b-4de6-bc3f-e760032cc8a2",
                        "entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "teratologies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ec18ffe-6874-30bb-be0a-d87434e241b8",
                        "entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The study of congenital malformations, their development, and people with them."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48993a05-0d62-33a0-8b1c-301e01542044",
                        "entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The study of the mechanisms, teratogenic agents, or teratogens, in bringing about malformations."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02feee16-2933-37e1-beea-91e6199a7ced",
                        "entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The study or cataloging of monsters."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87b8b5eb-6c24-45b7-bab6-45e6806f0af4",
                                "sense_id": "02feee16-2933-37e1-beea-91e6199a7ced",
                                "text": "...I would identify a more recent and widespread tendency to remove evil from the realm of a properly human interpretation: what I call a postmodern teratology of the sublime."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82d27ba3-f20c-4424-bf4d-6d316df018e9",
                                "sense_id": "02feee16-2933-37e1-beea-91e6199a7ced",
                                "text": "Despite being productive in embodying and critiquing human problems, however, the incorporation of the cyborg into teratology overlooks one important aspect that distinguishes this cybernetic creature from the rest of the monster phylum: we are able to choose how to fabricate and use the cyborg."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39e2b61d-ff91-4c39-b785-62201d49e196",
                                "sense_id": "02feee16-2933-37e1-beea-91e6199a7ced",
                                "text": "In this way, this analysis has aimed at expanding gaga feminism by undertaking a critical teratology, that is, of course, the study of monsters"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "686ca0e4-f5b1-452e-b227-418b05c5858c",
                                "sense_id": "02feee16-2933-37e1-beea-91e6199a7ced",
                                "text": "Miranda Francus notes that in the West, the image of the fecund female has often been associated with monstrosity: 'misogyny and teratology have always met in the image of the maternal monster'."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa7f0d53-c35b-4179-b1d4-72dd39939d6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
                        "source_sense_description": "(medicine) study of congenital malformations",
                        "target_lang_word": "tératologie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tératologie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aff2cdf5-0f18-3288-857a-07b58556ae70",
                                        "entry_id": "aedb97f9-5346-34d1-a2a6-ea659f312c50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Partie des sciences naturelles qui traite des malformations congénitales et des monstruosités organiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "daf51010-a477-4386-896c-6e7a47e0330f",
                                                "sense_id": "aff2cdf5-0f18-3288-857a-07b58556ae70",
                                                "text": "On en vient à lui attribuer presque toutes les malformations, presque toutes les monstruosités ; c’est l’âge d’or de la tératologie syphilitique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60f8bf0f-ed86-4e04-a828-40edc9f3293f",
                                                "sense_id": "aff2cdf5-0f18-3288-857a-07b58556ae70",
                                                "text": "Car c’est souvent en étudiant un phénomène dans un contexte extrême que l’on atteint sa substantifique moelle. Cette méthode a un nom : la tératologie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "86e9e977-21eb-4fa5-89ee-2e8e27eb403d",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e344733-f843-39d6-84c2-fb6b4245c00b",
